#20602
The Last Caravan~
   A caravan of a dozen wagons lies half buried in the ash, its oxen turned
to grey stone in their traces. The drivers sit on their benches, also stone,
their faces frozen in the moment they looked west and saw what was coming.
The cargo has been looted by something with claws.
~
