#20603
The Camp of the Ash-Eaters~
   Low shelters of bone and hide crouch in a hollow between dunes. The tribe
that lives here eats ash, because there is nothing else, and it has changed
them: grey-skinned, black-eyed, their teeth worn to stumps. They worship the
thing beneath the dead lake.
~
