#20604
The Ash-Chief's Hut~
   A hut of whale-sized bones roofed with grey hide. Inside, a fire of bones
burns without smoke. The ash-chief squats beside it, painted in white ash, a
necklace of stone fingers around her throat. Offerings for the Wyrm are
heaped against the walls.
~
