#20605
The Feeding Pit~
   A pit dug in the ash where the tribe throws its sacrifices for the Wyrm.
The bottom is out of sight, and warm air rises from it, smelling of embers.
Now and then the ash at the bottom heaves, and something vast turns over far
below.
