#20606
The Worm Tunnels~
   A round tunnel bored through packed ash and stone, its walls glazed
smooth by the heat of whatever made it. It is wide enough for a wagon. The
air is hot and the walls tremble. Smaller tunnels branch off in every
direction, and things move in them.
~
