#20609
The Edge of the Stone Forest~
   A forest stands here, every tree turned to grey stone, every leaf, every
bird on every branch. The stone trees creak in the wind as though they still
remember being wood. A deer stands frozen mid-leap in a clearing, and its
stone eyes follow you.
