#20610
The Heart of the Stone Forest~
   In the heart of the petrified forest, a village of woodcutters was caught
in the moment the Blight passed over it: a woman with a bucket, children
chasing a dog, a man splitting logs, all grey stone. Their stone faces are
turned west, and all of them are weeping.
~
