The Dead Lake Bed~
   You walk out across the cracked lake bed toward the crater. The heat
rises through your boots. Bones of fish as big as boats lie half buried in
the salt. The crater's edge is close now, and you can hear breathing from
it, slow and vast, like a bellows.
~
