#20617
The Crater of the Ashen Wyrm~
   You descend into the crater, a pit of glazed rock and hot ash a hundred
paces across. Coiled in its depths, its body as thick as a tower and grey as
the waste, lies the Ashen Wyrm. It burned the lake dry when it came, and the
waste is its breath. One eye opens, as big as a door, burning grey.
~
