#20619
The Glass Ruins of Sarn~
   North of the glass plain rise the ruins of Sarn, a city that stood here
when the waste was farmland. Whatever came out of the West melted it where
it stood. Towers lean like candles left too near a fire, and the streets are
rivers of black glass with shapes trapped inside them, people caught in mid-
stride.
~
