#20620
The Melted Spire~
   Inside the tallest of Sarn's towers the stairs have run together into a
smooth glass ramp that spirals up into darkness. The walls are clear as
water, and through them you see the waste outside bent and wrong. Someone
still lives here, at the top of the ramp, among books fused into bricks of
glass.
~
